(text "V0.3 读图说明 | Charger 单节电池充电" (at 426 18 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "44f0fefa-02c1-575d-83ea-8e854f8e7ab4"))
(text "用途：BQ24075 单节 1S 4.2V 电池充电/电源路径。" (at 426 26 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a26eebe4-1fb3-5a78-a579-e97cb9d1784a"))
(text "首次：J102 开路（禁充）；J103 开路（USB100）。" (at 426 30.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61955bc2-c260-5e54-ad95-caed23cfaf1f"))
(text "J104：1=VBAT_PROT，2=GND，3=BAT_NTC。" (at 426 35.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cfedf2b4-42bb-5fad-8b92-7083471d59b6"))
(text "仅接受保护电池包和真实贴近电芯的 NTC。" (at 426 39.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "abfadcb2-cfe0-552e-ba29-68873057bd36"))
(text "充电器不是独立电池保护板；禁止裸无保护电芯。" (at 426 44.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed41bb53-66a8-5786-adba-65c54f7ae5c2"))
(text "J103 闭合时输入限流约 418mA；充电约 249mA。" (at 426 48.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a84f48b-c486-5641-8f7d-82d206d65a59"))
(text "系统与充电共用预算，USB100 不保证系统能启动。" (at 426 53.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "47565746-1bce-5543-83ba-6f60614773ba"))
(text "确认电流、NTC、散热和电池安全后再启充。" (at 426 57.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bacdccbc-4ec7-5476-ab97-04040b616149"))
